// Planted crops. `crop` is the mature block and the seed item; `sprout` holds the cell while it grows.
// Every `roll_ticks` (120 per second) a positional roll below the per-mille chance advances one stage.
// Light is max(torch light, 15 under open sky) at the crop cell. Water within 4 cells uses `wet_per_mille`.
// `wild_seed_per_mille` is the seed chance per cubic metre of the wild block broken.
// `planting` places the cell: Soil (air on soil), Submerged (water, water above), Paddy (water, air above),
// Floating (air on water), Side (beside soil), Hanging (under soil), Grafted (set by a grown tree's `fruit`).
// `regrow` rows are picked with Use back to `sprout`. `gourd` stems set `crop` on free ground beside them.
// `aura` rows are working blocks: Mana, Collect, Harvest (reaps and replants ripe plots in range),
// `spread_per_mille`: a mature working flower plants a copy on free soil beside it per 2 s beat (stops at 3 nearby).
// Tend (each 2 s, 1 mana from a covering mana flower or receiver hurries every growing plot in range), Mist (plots in range count as watered).
// A Mana `feed` eats one loose `item` within `reach_metres` per 2 s pulse for `mana_per_item` mana.
// `produce` pays that resource index instead of `crop`. `food` makes the `crop` item edible.
// `cargo test crops_ron_round_trips` checks the format.
